== Description ==

'''Hemp Rope''' is a raw material in ''[[Human Host]]'', harvested from the world (trees, rocks, salvage). It appears as an ingredient in 49 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Damaged Wooden Boards]], [[Log Door Frame]], [[Wooden Shield]], [[Small Log Stairs]], [[Log Window Frame]], [[Log Floor]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

